re accessible via `/uploads/<filename>`. I\'m happy with this, and I\'m ready to continue with the next phase of `server.ts`.\n\n\n**Considering Admin Login**\n\nI\'m now focusing on secure admin login. Supabase Auth is suitable when deployed, but I need a local mode solution. I\'ll integrate an email/password login from `.env` with a secure `.env` comparison. To support custom local passwords, I\'ll store a hashed admin user in local mode, ensuring a robust and secure admin authentication process whether I\'m using Supabase or local environments.\n\n\n"
