      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n      <button class=\\\"p-2 text-gray-500 hover:bg-gray-100 rounded-full\\\">\\n        <svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" class=\\\"h-6 w-6\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\">\\n          <path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M8.228 9c.549-1.165 2.03-2 3.772-2 2.21 0 4 1.343 4 3 0 1.4-1.278 2.575-3.006 2.907-.542.104-.994.54-.994 1.093m0 3h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\\\" />\\n        </svg>\\n      </button>\\n      <div class=\\\"w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-400 to-indigo-600 border-2 border-white shadow-sm\\\"></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"flex flex-1 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n    <!-- Sidebar -->\\n    <aside class=\\\"w-60 bg-white border-l border-gray-200 p-6 flex flex-col gap-2 shrink-0\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 pr-2\\\">\330\247\331\204\330\247\331\203\330\252\330\264\330\247\331\201</div>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2.5 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 rounded-xl font-medium\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"text-lg\\\">\360\237\216\256</span> \330\247\331\204\330\243\331\204\330\271\330\247\330\250 \330\247\331\204\331\205\331\205\331\212\330\262\330\251\\n      </a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2.5 text-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-50 rounded-xl font-medium transition-colors\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"text-lg\\\">\360\237\223\210</span> \330\247\331\204\330\243\331\203\330\253\330\261 \330\261\331\210\330\247\330\254\330\247\331\213\\n      </a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2.5 text-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-50 rounded-xl font-medium transition-colors\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"text-lg\\\">\360\237\206\225</span> \330\243\330\255\330\257\330\253 \330\