  planner_response {
    modified_response: "I have resolved the Supabase connection error and added an elegant database setup helper directly into the app.\n\n### What Was Done:\n- **Clean DB Warning Logging**: Replaced raw, truncated object stringification inside `/server.ts` with clean `.message` serialization for database helper warnings to prevent log clutter.\n- **Dynamic Database Diagnostics**: Added an active `games` table presence check in the `/api/config-status` endpoint. When Supabase is configured in the environment but the table hasn\'t been created yet, it will now flag this state to the client interface.\n- **Interactive SQL Setup Guide**:\n  - Implemented an elegant setup panel inside the **Admin Panel** that automatically detects if the `games` table is missing in your Supabase database.\n  - Included a copyable **PostgreSQL SQL Schema Code block** with a one-click button `\331\206\330\263\330\256 \331\203\331\210\330\257 SQL` utilizing the browser\'s clipboard API.\n  - Provided clear steps in Arabic on how to run the setup query within the Supabase SQL Editor.\n- **Graceful Local Storage Fallback**: The app continues to use local JSON file persistence seamlessly as a fallback when the database table has not been initialized yet, preventing any service disruptions or crashes."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
