  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Clarifying Supabase Configuration**\n\nI\'ve got the user\'s Supabase URL, which is `https://jhybcklarhtltmpgzsbg.supabase.co`. I\'m now focusing on how they\'ll configure it, which should happen through the \"Settings\" or \"Secrets\" panel in the Google AI Studio Build UI. This corresponds to the `SUPABASE_URL` and `SUPABASE_KEY` variables.\n\n\n**Refining Key Configuration**\n\nI\'m now detailing user instructions for setting `SUPABASE_URL` and `SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`. I\'ll explain that API keys and secrets are managed via the Settings menu, where they\'ll be prompted to provide the values. Furthermore, I\'ve verified how these variables are used in `server.ts`. We implemented a graceful fallback to Local Storage mode if either key is missing or is set to placeholder text, and included an Admin Panel alert showing the user if Supabase is connected but the table is missing, along with the correct SQL to execute.\n\n\n**Detailing Supabase Setup**\n\nI\'m now outlining the steps for users to configure their Supabase connection within the Google AI Studio Build UI. I will clearly indicate that the Supabase URL and Anon Key are set in the Settings/Secrets panel. I\'m also confirming the app\'s built-in detection and Admin Panel guidance for table creation, including copy-paste SQL. I will detail the steps in Arabic to maintain consistency with the app\'s branding. I\'ve ensured no code changes are needed at this stage, focusing on a helpful, clear user experience.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "\330\261\330\247\330\246\330\271 \330\254\330\257\330\247\331\213! \331\204\330\252\331\201\330\271\331\212\331\204 \331\207\330\260\330\247 \330\247\331\204\330\261\330\247\330\250\330\267 \331\210\330\261\330\250\330\267 \330\252\330\267\330\250\331\212\331\202\331\203 \330\250\331\202\330\247\330\271\330\257\330\251 \330\250\331\212\330\247\331\206\330\247\330\252 **Supabase** \330\247\331\204\330\256\330\247\330\265\330\251 \330\250\331\203\330\214 \331\212\330\261\330\254\331\211 \330\247\330\252\330\250\330\247\330\271 \330\247\331\204\330\256\330\267\331\210\330\247\330\252 \330\247\331\204\330\250\330\263\331\212\330\267\330\251 \330\247\331\204\330\252\330\247\331\204\331\212\330\251:\n\n### 1\357\270\217\342\203\243 \330\245\330\266\330\247\331\201\330\251 \330\247\331\204\330\261\330\247\330\250\330\267 \331\210\330\247\331\204\331\205\331\201\330\252\330\247\330\255 \331\201\331\212 \330\245\330\271\330\257\330\247\330\257\330\247\330\252 \330\247\331\204\330\250\331\212\330\246\330\251 (Secrets)\n\331\212\330\252\331\205 \330\245\330\257\330\247\330\261\330\251 \331\205\331\201\330\247\330\252\331\212\330\255 \331\210\331\205\330\255\330\257\330\257\330\247\330\252 \330\247\331\204\330\247\330\252\330\265\330\247\331\204 \330\250\330\264\331\203\331\204 \330\242\331\205\331\206 \331\205\331\206 \330\256\331\204\330\247\331\204 \331\210\330\247\330\254\331\207\330\251 Google AI Studio Build:\n1. \330\247\330\260\331\207\330\250 \330\245\331\204\331\211 \331\202\330\247\330\246\331\205\330\251 **\330\247\331\204\330\245\330\271\330\257\330\247\330\257\330\247\330\252 (Settings)** \330\243\331\210 \331\204\331\210\330\255\330\251 **\330\247\331\204\330\243\330\263\330\261\330\247\330\261 (Secrets)** \331\201\331\212 \330\264\330\261\331\212\330\267 \330\243\330\257\331\210\330\247\330\252 \330\247\331\204\330\252\330\267\330\250\331\212\331\202.\n2. \331\202\331\205 \330\250\330\245\330\266\330\247\331\201\330\251 \330\247\331\204\331\205\330\252\330\272\331\212\330\261\330\247\330\252 \330\247\331\204\330\252\330\247\331\204\331\212\330\251 \331\210\331\202\331\212\331\205\331\207\330\247:\n   * **`SUPABASE_URL`**: \330\266\330\271 \331\201\331\212\331\207 \330\247\331\204\330\261\330\247\330\250\330\267 \330\247\331\204\330\256\330\247\330\265 \330\250\331\203: `https://jhybcklarhtltmpgzsbg.supabase.co`\n   * **`SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`**: \330\266\330\271 \331\201\331\212\331\207 \331\205\331\201\330\252\330\247\330\255 \330\247\331\204\331\200 **Anon Key** \330\247\331\204\330\256\330\247\330\265 \330\250\331\205\330\264\330\261\331\210\330\271\331\203 (\330\252\330\254\330\257 \331\207\330\260\330\247 \330\247\331\204\331\205\331\201\330\252\330\247\330\255 \331\201\331\212 \331\204\331\210\330\255\330\251 \330\252\330\255\331\203\331\205 Supabase \330\247\331\204\330\256\330\247\330\265\330\251 \330\250\331\203 \330\252\330\255\330\252 \330\256\331\212\330\247\330\261 *API Settings*).\n\n---\n\n### 2\357\270\217\342\203\243 \330\252\331\207\331\212\330\246\330\251 \330\254\330\257\331\210\331\204 \330\247\331\204\330\250\331\212\330\247\331\206\330\247\330\252 \330\252\331\204\331\202\330\247\330\246\331\212\330\247\331\213\n\331\204\331\202\330\257 \331\202\331\205\330\252 \330\250\330\245\330\266\330\247\331\201\330\251 \331\205\331\212\330\262\330\251 \330\260\331\203\331\212\330\251 \331\201\331\212 **\331\204\331\210\330\255\330\251 \330\247\331\204\330\245\330\257\330\247\330\261\330\251 (Admin Panel)** \330\250\330\247\331\204\330\252\330\267\330\250\331\212\331\202\330\233 \330\250\331\205\330\254\330\261\330\257 \330\255\331\201\330\270 \331\207\330\260\331\207 \330\247\331\204\330\245\330\271\330\257\330\247\330\257\330\247\330\252 \331\210\330\252\330\255\330\257\331\212\330\253 \330\247\331\204\330\265\331\201\330\255\330\251:\n* \330\263\331\212\330\252\330\271\330\261\331\201 \330\247\331\204\330\252\330\267\330\250\331\212\331\202 \330\252\331\204\331\202\330\247\330\246\331\212