    summary: "The \"Invalid path specified in request URL\" error (PostgREST error code `PGRST125`, HTTP status 404) in Supabase typically indicates that the API endpoint you are trying to access does not correspond to an exposed table, view, or function in your PostgreSQL database.[1][2][3]\n\nHere are the common causes and troubleshooting steps for this error:\n\n**Common Causes:**\n\n*   **Non-existent Table, View, or Function** The most frequent reason is that the table, view, or stored procedure specified in your API request URL does not exist in your Supabase database or is misspelled. Supabase automatically generates RESTful API endpoints directly from your database schema.[1][4][5][6][3]\n*   **Incorrect Schema Exposure** Your database objects (tables, views, functions) must reside in a schema that is exposed to the PostgREST API. By default, the `public` schema is exposed, but if you\'re using custom schemas, they need to be explicitly added in your Supabase project settings.[7][8][3]\n*   **Stale Schema Cache** After making changes to your database schema (e.g., creating a new table, dropping a schema), PostgREST\'s internal cache might become stale and not immediately recognize the updates. This can lead to the API reporting an \"invalid path.\"[8][9]\n*   **Incorrect Base URL** While less common for this specific error, ensuring your API requests use the correct Supabase Project URL, which follows the format `https://<PROJECT_REF>.supabase.co/rest/v1/`, is crucial.[4][5]\n*   **Missing Database Privileges** Although usually resulting in a \"permission denied\" error, if the `anon` or `authenticated` roles lack the necessary `SELECT` (or `INSERT`, `UPDATE`, `DELETE`) privileges on the database object, the API might not be able to resolve the path correctly.[7]\n*   **Data API Disabled** If the Data API feature is intentionally disabled for your Supabase project, PostgREST will not serve any endpoints, leading to path invalidation errors.[10]\n\n**Troubleshooting Steps:**\n\n1.  **Verify Table/View/Function Name and Existence:**\n    *   Double-check the exact spelling and casing of the table, view, or function in your API request URL against your actual database schema in the Supabase Dashboard\'s Table Editor or SQL Editor.[7][3]\n    *   Confirm that the database object you are trying to access actually exists in your project.\n\n2.  **Check Exposed Schemas:**\n    *   Navigate to your Supabase Dashboard > Project Settings > Data API.\n    *   Under \"Exposed Schemas,\" ensure that the schema containing your target table, view, or function is listed. If not, add it.\n    *   If you\'re using the `public` schema and have created new tables, ensure \"Default privileges for new entities\" is enabled to automatically grant API access.[7]\n\n3.  **Refresh Schema Cache:**\n    *   If you\'ve recently made database changes and are encountering this error, a schema cache issue might be present. In some cases, navigating to the \"Data API\" settings in your Supabase Dashboard and simply saving the settings (even without making changes) can prompt a refresh. If a schema was dropped and still listed as exposed, removing it from the \"Exposed Schemas\" list and saving is necessary.[8]\n\n4.  **Review API URL and Path Structure:**\n    *   Ensure your API request URL follows the standard Supabase PostgREST format: `https://<YOUR_PROJECT_REF>.supabase.co/rest/v1/<YOUR_TABLE_OR_FUNCTION_NAME>`. The `<YOUR_TABLE_OR_FUNCTION_NAME>` should directly follow `/v1/`.[4][5]\n\n5.  **Examine Supabase Logs:**\n    *   Check the \"Logs\" section in your Supabase Dashboard, particularly the Postgres and PostgREST logs, for more specific error messages (e.g., `PGRST002` for schema cache issues) that can provide further clues.[1][8][2][10][9]\n\nSources:\n[1] [supabase.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG5ATQePNlg3UUOYihc1iMTvn3MtrxN_ewz0xDmzNvk-pWaKyxnYFSK11JHO_9hSX8U--kL2oVlMjwfC5Arhu3FVC90NHep1wHNB56hz39eSn5p-sYGvfdqg6ZeWxzUm4sUaBLDIl6R0MJfjhDfSM2RWzW4I7ZyErVq)\n[2] [postgrest.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFmBckzDS_N13JBX7w-6yDD5ejQwXFJVmLn3EfZAQQieyA9vehE5rLTDoPiujuDgxPPY4Juav5lSAjiYZx7Zc7GC94Wl44inRj-B4D5YxFIcsnYEKq9no3DBu7-6fLiXm_SRiNnAidvzX4YyQY1VqtHOpIjXbY=)\n[3] [postgrest.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEV4FN_-RF9_Lz51zky4YVlmqzDA-_4pRVj4Xuyp4JWL4QUXRDGUtiOhR8DpPhRvKReom6j2fJDTFyRh75GNuibo9UxwdHlW8EDD_G4Tiqr9qJ0-bnz_Y3HAeWMFQQS0R_axy-qR1p0rVA0mLkgxYPFRGI=)\n[4] [mintlify.app](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE33cBG4Xt9S-WA0qll46wClwY2k04M37U8_XkrFKY30thlLq3m83Vcq402k7CLsqdO7D7ge4jdgpLhLtTmTpUEd6YYx4_Jb25wTnPl7-LZHnkVYFQ2yDFZbx6hqiFfPl0HriKIFRVVSRPoL0uWRQ-Shaw=)\n[5] [supabase.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGSHPpgD2VfUT06TA7F_pveTJW775CZlz58nI3J-OrHQs1H7wgBW0Hw_R35gsXxysKA9Z8YVT1oUEHGyVvkrPZkQ89lEeRsQtPKx_uQRhis_yH04PoA40xr4nMhMaRS)\n[6] [supabase.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFbwszP9AZVHS6UXekVe2cpoCIkShcQk-3woWbkcABCbUss53qq-NP1IKcPFvSGZJndjcv5kgC4pYtSRWNYEU5WzEx2CRQsgBvn50Y4pJsv7H5psBqgp6nI5r2SB_K6SSbm3C6FDPTnNjUn8qnYGbrEr9I=)\n[7] [supabase.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEJurgbBanECKXxT9oRkjhXzFBMQanF4wNJcKtSH1B154jMDrKO9TIcUP8zwExoAEblBgbcJo4HGI8z9-chN5g_MnKUDVxZHyhsdpaGCAxLRM69Mjk1jsm1s9Rz2uQ5M2leT_jHqSbSsWPsb-xZ9g==)\n[8] [supabase.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH_68eZOIXrMEwJ6bCzXr07u63gpX8Uw6eon54j6WwJeFPS7xFhmE-QUZBGVswuzOZJzr7z0g9WK4CvIwzpVn_iEPCdBTCsbKXE9szIb9tXjT8FVoQpJiRF7FFEWiQ0SOO9FsecKY1skQ131BVXzL4RzmPIUpNUOpmD3dbK76ovfpQGEs-fYIjHq51L70lPlPeQruQ5ExNrCCAhu40Uc57Q654kBvMXuaQfd5N5vHshFhuRawN5OtizPucZlCU=)\n[9] [supabase.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGNNDJQZQoUNTMzFDm6xOqgt_J-32Fjyiky9t-zu05YmbHQXOlXzWH7dTbAg_kMAOPCH0EbhKzc9cnsfG6RSzSh_PXBGZp6WFSz4Nr73jzAy0NxMnPdaj8h3sC6OzXdsMqWleFhcbCcY-62)\n[10] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH5xqrGXs8-8xcsXaycSZiBE0ynKJxMkS_Vzlo6ePZvMYn1MKQlZcCtTpl4-9jLDIK8Nzv4V_ueOVjAlHihJo4E7xlkyLatzS2anyx1nf4Aa4i3FPvwd4zqNchFeTcYfT9iHaQfakjbVsAMKg==)"
    search_type: SEARCH_WEB_TYPE_WEB
