          text: "### Uh oh!\nThere was an error while loading. [Please reload this page](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYVcQSgEaf4C-faMzfIoCjznqndJN1B7OneECzhvqA-bNBf3ZN6q145gz0JmWTCwKEpgRM58wLWYXdMKj42nEst_BofzMEeEiKUJCl2mQECEozd1JHir-sYA4yL_kc1sM8lFqPkp2bdXAzsd8=).\n\n### [GaryAustin1](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/GaryAustin1) [Apr 21, 2022](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYVcQSgEaf4C-faMzfIoCjznqndJN1B7OneECzhvqA-bNBf3ZN6q145gz0JmWTCwKEpgRM58wLWYXdMKj42nEst_BofzMEeEiKUJCl2mQECEozd1JHir-sYA4yL_kc1sM8lFqPkp2bdXAzsd8=#discussioncomment-2611288) Collaborator\n[GaryAustin1](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/GaryAustin1)\n[Apr 21, 2022](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYVcQSgEaf4C-faMzfIoCjznqndJN1B7OneECzhvqA-bNBf3ZN6q145gz0JmWTCwKEpgRM58wLWYXdMKj42nEst_BofzMEeEiKUJCl2mQECEozd1JHir-sYA4yL_kc1sM8lFqPkp2bdXAzsd8=#discussioncomment-2611288)\n-\nCan you look in your supabase object returned from the client init and see what the base url is? If there is an extra character like /n I believe Supabase.js still works, but I know storage.js does not. Realtime.js also may not handle it. [#5819](https://github.com/supabase/supabase/issues/5819)\nBeta Was this translation helpful? [Give feedback.](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYVcQSgEaf4C-faMzfIoCjznqndJN1B7OneECzhvqA-bNBf3ZN6q145gz0JmWTCwKEpgRM58wLWYXdMKj42nEst_BofzMEeEiKUJCl2mQECEozd1JHir-sYA4yL_kc1sM8lFqPkp2bdXAzsd8=)\n-\n\n### Uh oh!\nThere was an error while loading. [Please reload this page](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYVcQSgEaf4C-faMzfIoCjznqndJN1B7OneECzhvqA-bNBf3ZN6q145gz0JmWTCwKEpgRM58wLWYXdMKj42nEst_BofzMEeEiKUJCl2mQECEozd1JHir-sYA4yL_kc1sM8lFqPkp2bdXAzsd8=).\n\n### Uh oh!\nThere was an error while loading. [Please reload this page](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYVcQSgEaf