          text: "### Uh oh!\nThere was an error while loading. [Please reload this page](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYVcQSgEaf4C-faMzfIoCjznqndJN1B7OneECzhvqA-bNBf3ZN6q145gz0JmWTCwKEpgRM58wLWYXdMKj42nEst_BofzMEeEiKUJCl2mQECEozd1JHir-sYA4yL_kc1sM8lFqPkp2bdXAzsd8=).\n\n#### [react-ghost](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/react-ghost) [Apr 23, 2022](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYVcQSgEaf4C-faMzfIoCjznqndJN1B7OneECzhvqA-bNBf3ZN6q145gz0JmWTCwKEpgRM58wLWYXdMKj42nEst_BofzMEeEiKUJCl2mQECEozd1JHir-sYA4yL_kc1sM8lFqPkp2bdXAzsd8=#discussioncomment-2621396) Author\n[react-ghost](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/react-ghost)\n[Apr 23, 2022](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYVcQSgEaf4C-faMzfIoCjznqndJN1B7OneECzhvqA-bNBf3ZN6q145gz0JmWTCwKEpgRM58wLWYXdMKj42nEst_BofzMEeEiKUJCl2mQECEozd1JHir-sYA4yL_kc1sM8lFqPkp2bdXAzsd8=#discussioncomment-2621396)\n-\n[@w3b6x9](https://github.com/w3b6x9) Just updated to @supabase/supabase-js v 1.35.2 which looks like it\'s using realtime-js@1.7.2 and I can confirm that I am no longer receiving the error - It would\'ve happened immediately at app load. Looks like you ended up maybe just removing those lines??\nLooks like it\'s resolved though, thanks a million for that!\nBeta Was this translation helpful? [Give feedback.](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYVcQSgEaf4C-faMzfIoCjznqndJN1B7OneECzhvqA-bNBf3ZN6q145gz0JmWTCwKEpgRM58wLWYXdMKj42nEst_BofzMEeEiKUJCl2mQECEozd1JHir-sYA4yL_kc1sM8lFqPkp2bdXAzsd8=)\n- \n              \342\235\244\357\270\217\n              1\n\n[react-ghost](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/react-ghost)\n-\n\n### Uh oh!\nThere was an error while loading. [Please reload this page](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYVcQSgEaf4C-faMzfIoCjznqndJN1B7OneECzhvqA-bNBf3ZN6q145gz0JmWTCwKEpgRM58wLWYXdMKj42nEst_BofzMEeEiKUJCl2mQECEozd1JHir-sYA4yL_kc1sM8lFqPkp2bdXAzsd8=).\n\n### Uh oh!\nThere was an error while loading. [Please reload this page](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYVcQSgEaf4C-faMzfIoCjznqndJN1B7OneECzhvqA-bNBf3ZN6q145gz0JmWTCwKEpgRM58wLWYXdMKj42nEst_BofzMEeEiKUJCl2mQECEozd1JHir-sYA4yL_kc1sM8lFqPkp2bdXAzsd8=).\n\n### [GaryAustin1](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/GaryAustin1) [Apr 22, 2022](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYVcQSgEaf4C-faMzfIoCjznqndJN1B7OneECzhvqA-bNBf3ZN6q145gz0JmWTCwKEpgRM58wLWYXdMKj42nEst_BofzMEeEiKUJCl2mQECEozd1JHir-sYA4yL_kc1sM8lFqPkp2bdXAzsd8=#discussioncomment-2612255) Collaborator\n[GaryAustin1](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/GaryAustin1)\n[Apr 22, 2022](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYVcQSgEaf4C-faMzfIoCjznqndJN1B7OneECzhvqA-bNBf3ZN6q145gz0JmWTCwKEpgRM58wLWYXdMKj42nEst_BofzMEeEiKUJCl2mQECEozd1JHir-sYA4yL_kc1sM8lFqPkp2bdXAzsd8=#discussioncomment-2612255)\n-\nYeah, I\'m not trying to say change, just trying to narrow down the issue. That module is not part of Supabase, so something about react native, versions of node, etc., but without just random googling on wss react native, react native supabase realtime. Don\'t have more for you.\nBeta Was this translation helpful? [Give feedback.](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYVcQSgEaf4C-faMzfIoCjznqndJN1B7OneECzhvqA-bNBf3ZN6q145gz0JmWTCwKEpgRM58wLWYXdMKj42nEst_BofzMEeEiKUJCl2mQECEozd1JHir-sYA4yL_kc1sM8lFqPkp2bdXAzsd8=)\n-\n\n### Uh oh!\nThere was an error while loading. [Please reload this page](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYVcQSgEaf4C-faMzfIoCjznqndJN1B7OneECzhvqA-bNBf3ZN6q145gz0JmWTCwKEpgRM58wLWYXdMKj42nEst_BofzMEeEiKUJCl2mQECEozd1JHir-sYA4yL_kc1sM8lFqPkp2bdXAzsd8=)."
