          text: "There was an error while loading. [Please reload this page](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYVcQSgEaf4C-faMzfIoCjznqndJN1B7OneECzhvqA-bNBf3ZN6q145gz0JmWTCwKEpgRM58wLWYXdMKj42nEst_BofzMEeEiKUJCl2mQECEozd1JHir-sYA4yL_kc1sM8lFqPkp2bdXAzsd8=).\n\n#### [react-ghost](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/react-ghost) [Apr 22, 2022](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYVcQSgEaf4C-faMzfIoCjznqndJN1B7OneECzhvqA-bNBf3ZN6q145gz0JmWTCwKEpgRM58wLWYXdMKj42nEst_BofzMEeEiKUJCl2mQECEozd1JHir-sYA4yL_kc1sM8lFqPkp2bdXAzsd8=#discussioncomment-2612271) Author\n[react-ghost](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/react-ghost)\n[Apr 22, 2022](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYVcQSgEaf4C-faMzfIoCjznqndJN1B7OneECzhvqA-bNBf3ZN6q145gz0JmWTCwKEpgRM58wLWYXdMKj42nEst_BofzMEeEiKUJCl2mQECEozd1JHir-sYA4yL_kc1sM8lFqPkp2bdXAzsd8=#discussioncomment-2612271)\n-\nOkay, well that\'s a good start - thanks for that info. I would\'ve certainly assumed it WAS apart of Supabase and didn\'t really know how to find out otherwise. Thanks a bunch for that.\nBeta Was this translation helpful? [Give feedback.](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYVcQSgEaf4C-faMzfIoCjznqndJN1B7OneECzhvqA-bNBf3ZN6q145gz0JmWTCwKEpgRM58wLWYXdMKj42nEst_BofzMEeEiKUJCl2mQECEozd1JHir-sYA4yL_kc1sM8lFqPkp2bdXAzsd8=)\n[Sign up for free](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/join?source=comment-repo)\n[Sign in to comment](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Forgs%2Fsupabase%2Fdiscussions%2F6522)\n[\342\235\223\n\n      Questions](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/orgs/supabase/discussions/categories/questions)\n- \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n          Heading\n\n\n\n\n- \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n          Bold\n\n\n\n\n- \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n          Italic\n\n\n\n\n- \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n          Quote\n\n\n\n\n- \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  