          text: "- [Setting Response Headers](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGlp7pqcMaiVILujkl5VjZZXzDXPQHRahDDEWD0fuM1aFbUwGyJLYF3Wlzv59CldJtbiIO-x-wIv-foLdzuRi8uni_stdKGVWt1f25m5kVyoVlGIZUIs_h3-pAeLmNCbQFPykiYLQ==#setting-response-headers)\n[Setting headers via pre-request](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGlp7pqcMaiVILujkl5VjZZXzDXPQHRahDDEWD0fuM1aFbUwGyJLYF3Wlzv59CldJtbiIO-x-wIv-foLdzuRi8uni_stdKGVWt1f25m5kVyoVlGIZUIs_h3-pAeLmNCbQFPykiYLQ==#setting-headers-via-pre-request)\n\n\n- [Setting headers via pre-request](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGlp7pqcMaiVILujkl5VjZZXzDXPQHRahDDEWD0fuM1aFbUwGyJLYF3Wlzv59CldJtbiIO-x-wIv-foLdzuRi8uni_stdKGVWt1f25m5kVyoVlGIZUIs_h3-pAeLmNCbQFPykiYLQ==#setting-headers-via-pre-request)\n- [Setting Response Status Code](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGlp7pqcMaiVILujkl5VjZZXzDXPQHRahDDEWD0fuM1aFbUwGyJLYF3Wlzv59CldJtbiIO-x-wIv-foLdzuRi8uni_stdKGVWt1f25m5kVyoVlGIZUIs_h3-pAeLmNCbQFPykiYLQ==#setting-response-status-code)\n- [Raise errors with HTTP Status Codes](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGlp7pqcMaiVILujkl5VjZZXzDXPQHRahDDEWD0fuM1aFbUwGyJLYF3Wlzv59CldJtbiIO-x-wIv-foLdzuRi8uni_stdKGVWt1f25m5kVyoVlGIZUIs_h3-pAeLmNCbQFPykiYLQ==#raise-errors-with-http-status-codes)\n- [Execution plan](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGlp7pqcMaiVILujkl5VjZZXzDXPQHRahDDEWD0fuM1aFbUwGyJLYF3Wlzv59CldJtbiIO-x-wIv-foLdzuRi8uni_stdKGVWt1f25m5kVyoVlGIZUIs_h3-pAeLmNCbQFPykiYLQ==#execution-plan)\n[Accessing Request Headers, Cookies and JWT claims](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGlp7pqcMaiVILujkl5VjZZXzDXPQHRahDDEWD0fuM1aFbUwGyJLYF3Wlzv59CldJtbiIO-x-wIv-foLdzuRi8uni_stdKGVWt1f25m5kVyoVlGIZUIs_h3-pAeLmNCbQFPykiYLQ==#accessing-request-headers-cookies-and-jwt-claims)\n- [Legacy GUC variable names](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGlp7pqcMaiVILujkl5VjZZXzDXPQHRahDDEWD0fuM1aFbUwGyJLYF3Wlzv59CldJtbiIO-x-wIv-foLdzuRi8uni_stdKGVWt1f25m5kVyoVlGIZUIs_h3-pAeLmNCbQFPykiYLQ==#legacy-guc-variable-names)\n[Legacy GUC variable names](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGlp7pqcMaiVILujkl5VjZZXzDXPQHRahDDEWD0fuM1aFbUwGyJLYF3Wlzv59CldJtbiIO-x-wIv-foLdzuRi8uni_stdKGVWt1f25m5kVyoVlGIZUIs_h3-pAeLmNCbQFPykiYLQ==#legacy-guc-variable-names)\n[Accessing Request Path and Method](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGlp7pqcMaiVILujkl5VjZZXzDXPQHRahDDEWD0fuM1aFbUwGyJLYF3Wlzv59CldJtbiIO-x-wIv-foLdzuRi8uni_stdKGVWt1f25m5kVyoVlGIZUIs_h3-pAeLmNCbQFPykiYLQ==#accessing-request-path-and-method)\n[Setting Response Headers](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGlp7pqcMaiVILujkl5VjZZXzDXPQHRahDDEWD0fuM1aFbUwGyJLYF3Wlzv59CldJtbiIO-x-wIv-foLdzuRi8uni_stdKGVWt1f25m5kVyoVlGIZUIs_h3-pAeLmNCbQFPykiYLQ==#setting-response-headers)\n- [Setting headers via pre-request](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGlp7pqcMaiVILujkl5VjZZXzDXPQHRahDDEWD0fuM1aFbUwGyJLYF3Wlzv59CldJtbiIO-x-wIv-foLdzuRi8uni_stdKGVWt1f25m5kVyoVlGIZUIs_h3-pAeLmNCbQFPykiYLQ==#setting-headers-via-pre-request)\n[Setting headers via pre-request](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGlp7pqcMaiVILujkl5VjZZXzDXPQHRahDDEWD0fuM1aFbUwGyJLYF3Wlzv59CldJtbiIO-x-wIv-foLdzuRi8uni_stdKGVWt1f25m5kVyoVlGIZUIs_h3-pAeLmNCbQFPykiYLQ==#setting-headers-via-pre-request)\n[Setting Response Status Code](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGlp7pqcMaiVILujkl5VjZZXzDXPQHRahDDEWD0fuM1aFbUwGyJLYF3Wlzv59CldJtbiIO-x-wIv-foLdzuRi8uni_stdKGVWt1f25m5kVyoVlGIZUIs_h3-pAeLmNCbQFPykiYLQ==#setting-response-status-code)\n[Raise errors with HTTP Status Codes](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGlp7pqcMaiVILujkl5VjZZXzDXPQHRahDDEWD0fuM1aFb