          text: "[Installation](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/install.html)\n[Running PostgREST](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/install.html#running-postgrest)\n[Docker](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/install.html#docker)\n[Building from Source](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/install.html#building-from-source)\n[Deploying to Heroku](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/install.html#deploying-to-heroku)\nHow-to guides\n- [Working with PostgreSQL data types](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/how-tos/working-with-postgresql-data-types.html)\n- [Providing images for <img>](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/how-tos/providing-images-for-img.html)\n- [Create a SOAP endpoint](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/how-tos/create-soap-endpoint.html)\n- [SQL User Management using postgres\342\200\231 users and passwords](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/how-tos/sql-user-management-using-postgres-users-and-passwords.html)\n[Working with PostgreSQL data types](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/how-tos/working-with-postgresql-data-types.html)\n[Providing images for <img>](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/how-tos/providing-images-for-img.html)\n\n```\n<img>\n```\n\n[Create a SOAP endpoint](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/how-tos/create-soap-endpoint.html)\n[SQL User Management using postgres\342\200\231 users and passwords](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/how-tos/sql-user-management-using-postgres-users-and-passwords.html)\nEcosystem\n- [Community Tutorials](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/ecosystem.html)\n- [Templates](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/ecosystem.html#templates)\n- [Example Apps](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/ecosystem.html#example-apps)\n- [DevOps](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/ecosystem.html#devops)\n- [External Notification](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/ecosystem.html#external-notification)\n- [Extensions](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/ecosystem.html#extensions)\n- [Client-Side Libraries](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/ecosystem.html#client-side-libraries)\n[Community Tutorials](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/ecosystem.html)\n[Templates](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/ecosystem.html#templates)\n[Example Apps](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/ecosystem.html#example-apps)\n[DevOps](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/ecosystem.html#devops)\n[External Notification](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/ecosystem.html#external-notification)\n[Extensions](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/ecosystem.html#extensions)\n[Client-Side Libraries](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/ecosystem.html#client-side-libraries)\n[PostgREST 10.2](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/index.html)\n- https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/index.html\n- Tables and Views\n- \n            [View page source](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/_sources/api.rst.txt)\n\n[View page source](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/_sources/api.rst.txt)"
