        markdown_chunk {
          headers {
            type: MARKDOWN_NODE_TYPE_HEADER_1
            text: "PostgREST schema cache not updating - PGRST204 errors\302\240#42183"
          }
          text: "[PostgREST schema cache not updating - PGRST204 errors](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFqzPAiqN0apY0UvpgTNK0Vpts9RO5VdnbULJfv61UK0Kq-obtiM6jWFgt66u2c3aG-af1ksLraAeocA4UEy4FHXdtoSsqMlkCXGQaFwEXe_1ykAqtojptUeFuEZ7nyqQNT03rEgaybUEUdRSs=#top)\n[bugSomething isn\'t working](https://github.com/supabase/supabase/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22bug%22)\n[databasePostgres and all-things-database](https://github.com/supabase/supabase/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22database%22)\n[external-issueCreated outside of Supabase](https://github.com/supabase/supabase/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22external-issue%22)\n[postgRESTRelated to PostgREST](https://github.com/supabase/supabase/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22postgREST%22)"
        }
