    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGijc4Gbk6GqsNefggp0-RYpWOO_yYHE7f7kM3oCre6rcyGMCY9behum0JUUevCbShATL3jgDFJv_DqVN_tJvSJ8GaXVWobAW6ITPjHHMNlEDX76CK1DawyaYZ41KzULH0qaeWsi9yyNLfZv85lYMM="
      title: "answeroverflow.com"
    }
    summary: "The \"Invalid path specified in request URL\" error in Supabase typically indicates an issue with how the API endpoint is being accessed or configured. Here are the common causes and solutions:\n\n*   **Incorrect API URL Format**\n    *   **Missing `/rest/v1/`**: Supabase\'s auto-generated REST API often requires `/rest/v1/` to be appended to your project\'s base URL, followed by the table or function name you are trying to access. For example, `https://<your-project-ref>.supabase.co/rest/v1/<your-table-name>`[1][2][3].\n    *   **Incorrect Project URL**: Ensure you are using the exact Project URL found in your Supabase Dashboard under \"Settings\" -> \"API\" -> \"Project URL\".[1][4]\n\n*   **API Key Issues**\n    *   While the error message points to the path, an incorrect or missing API key can sometimes lead to authentication failures that might present with related URL errors. Verify that you are including a valid API key (either `anon` for client-side or `service_role` for server-side, or the newer `publishable` and `secret` keys) in your requests. You can find these keys in the \"Settings\" -> \"API\" section of your Supabase dashboard.[1][5][2][4]\n\n*   **Table or Function Not Exposed/Found**\n    *   Supabase automatically creates API routes for your tables, views, and functions. If the table or function name in your URL is incorrect, doesn\'t exist, or lacks the necessary permissions (e.g., Row Level Security) for the role making the request, you might encounter this error.[5][3][6]\n    *   You can expose specific tables or functions via the Data API in the Supabase Dashboard under \"Integrations\" > \"Data API\".[5]\n\n*   **Supabase Storage Specific Errors**\n    *   If you\'re interacting with Supabase Storage, an \"InvalidFilePath\" error can occur due to an incorrectly formatted file path (e.g., missing slashes, incorrect directory names), unsupported characters in the file path, or exceeding the maximum allowed path length. File paths should generally follow the format: `bucket_name/folder_name/file_name.extension`.[7]\n\n*   **Authentication Redirect URL Misconfigurations (OAuth)**\n    *   When using OAuth providers (like Google Sign-In) with Supabase, especially in environments like Expo, misconfigured redirect URIs can lead to \"requested path is invalid\" errors. Ensure that the redirect URIs in your Google Cloud Console (or other OAuth provider) and Supabase Dashboard\'s authentication settings are correctly configured and match.[8]\n\n*   **Self-Hosting Considerations**\n    *   If you are self-hosting Supabase, specific configurations might be necessary to ensure API paths are correctly resolved.[9][10]\n\n*   **Stale Cache or Database Issues**\n    *   Occasionally, stale schema cache errors or outdated function signatures can prevent the API from correctly identifying database objects in your queries, leading to path-related errors.[6]\n\nTo troubleshoot, carefully review the exact URL you are using, confirm your API key is correct and present, and verify that the resource (table, function, storage path) exists and is accessible.\n\nSources:\n[1] [draftbit.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHUadU6ah_AFsHr8WLxXZ2pCGMjPouCpKuQXFl_PntAvSoH4alf7lknSTTSyJU-FLu2z4-7ohWWIVeQozDWGKjiiYHix_krVNp6A-5UoBzwe0873oZoIRXUznEOitvu7lRRnDs=)\n[2] [supabase.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG_HBo13qDPzf-yYlihRjFha0ics-eMPxcIpqzfCimkHozoNOTm26PyuDo5c3ucMczdmiguXpoCRI7j0rwrpPKgFr6SnuNzzGgj7FMhRgNUQOdp9TIiyipssfUB3cdhkg==)\n[3] [supabase.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEJMqx7UmDlEzSKNjSjBruvD17tDwZ_vWByKceylfcM56l9WSgG6OPiIgt9tVBHt-CXfHhtrSR-8bCFwm3PbceQKcTlzZ_2zxPojsUN1ptYDTo5w5zTmctD5V_3mf82tqO_fgzt_6n4TY8y)\n[4] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHtmUFurmuGlVn9vscXWSUfRyXnh5IVUlLWQ7suzIZpTLgM2VSsTcoCeCf_BNEl9QH-oxZEumm7KqtqQYrVL31Brknz4BbnUNJvf4jp1FvDF7PrOv-gAvVwBmcZHP6Iv6eqScd9dQ0=)\n[5] [supabase.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFMcJGsqBQKda0K4ArYxNyWwGJUvc9QT1elHB7J0EHXF7hLN_KIpER4QXvf8k47Yod9wsdXp8uZhk801TkgOs6PAgfaBS-zk80Lt3w6N7gTZDOBp2ORpZuGymRBi8KBd7a1VvV-cC9C1C2grzYJe6g=)\n[6] [supabase.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFSnck6gOnDOMj69Du5UCep5u4okh42IV4jl-pry6cwZauO8jmK-L2xOc-1SBAXocHudWwnUIBKxHHVmARoEfr-aHFDPOZDy_3EsvyZwFFZRfnJIg2X6gxz5BjzblX5Bac4lXESiIuJQir3khjBp-vYvuu3b_hFZ1nAPQ==)\n[7] [drdroid.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE78PWVfgoaOvZhk3o24zFk7LFDGQ1RmOba59pexrMfkfgl7BKjxuZADwmksqDsPaKY-qXyM2zi5Dkt53AqSIUbY1s2jV23Qv4YJYd221B6s2JG12RC34RGHZS6vliHrl1cveReHydCnuAJq616NyS_xrEp_15UXPx8g5iisbwefQI92e-EB3xDUrpDZXZLoa-JyIPr-l90NjxiUEgPfAqBiPQ4vgpzvxKoDxnP_wiP0a7X8zxzzW0YmUCyF-Pslzr_zc-zJDvCq63TQru2RA==)\n[8] [stackoverflow.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGNORtrKWUQ7apvLzrYqIntaZPBqG1LZXeU-U7f7iE07JaDO5uTGrgtNi6JkmQdfL3lNBo-FytCYExiX6jTyUF-9q4f9ge9y5kfcsDfTtneGHoVOs6WxELsgceVytvbXgn8A43wP55X_ErUkGLPQKJUJbMOjrFiGK3cFL3E-QfqFlDrli8RkjgvBRRwsck5rgD7b1wARK4e8ZACclfuq96izo_sZnJt9K5rpskuwhhCCwBcyz28OTd3)\n[9] [answeroverflow.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGTUIgiOQZPzhcKiGOJuMptKZxZWSEa3_8Onco9465WDaDI9Kar5w10Zi855WTQWPC27nyn9vi7uVBxMEb-w5vio6KROAk_MI6SzSlGv82hBlI1opFnSAM-aQncePl5hWDl792oqcfcIkOuFnN-oR4tCxgDCAy8FWKbzUtICnNj595xqIfs13d09ak5zeR_sDTCz8gSeNs43-c3A9unVXhhQxeyBacf6lsIyoSRMHxXG-I2c7EXOR8mxvizcTsN9quC6AnpP3gKUd9gOEUQyZgQG4EHVShuD7FywPNlSD9L42730qBExqOVdp5hDBk4PZ8b5AN4pV2LOGWYT4s66aHkbqp5s9vuxUBsXxUs1Pq20QpcW7wA9dp6XQqCpi6Xb_Fo8wO5Uwc=)\n[10] [answeroverflow.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGijc4Gbk6GqsNefggp0-RYpWOO_yYHE7f7kM3oCre6rcyGMCY9behum0JUUevCbShATL3jgDFJv_DqVN_tJvSJ8GaXVWobAW6ITPjHHMNlEDX76CK1DawyaYZ41KzULH0qaeWsi9yyNLfZv85lYMM=)"
