  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Flawless Linting**\n\nI\'m pleased to report the linting concluded without a single error \342\200\223 a perfect outcome! I\'m now cross-referencing this success with the project\'s requirements, specifically the \"\330\245\330\265\331\204\330\247\330\255 \330\255\330\260\331\201 \330\247\331\204\330\243\331\204\330\271\330\247\330\250 \331\210\330\247\331\204\330\252\330\267\330\250\331\212\331\202\330\247\330\252 \331\205\331\206\" request, to ensure full coverage.\n\n\n**Analyzing Delete Implementations**\n\nI\'ve made significant headway on the admin panel\'s delete functionality. The delete button now prompts for confirmation, then immediately updates the UI and refreshes the parent\'s catalog via a DELETE request and `onGamesChanged()`. Additionally, I\'ve integrated image removal from Cloudinary. The server-side now fetches the game, extracts the Cloudinary public ID, and destroys the image before database deletion, ensuring image removal.\n\n\n**Addressing Complete Deletion**\n\nI\'ve successfully ensured complete data deletion. The `deleteGameDB` function now rigorously handles data removal from Supabase (if active) and synchronizes local storage. I\'m pleased with the approach\'s thoroughness and robustness. I am now working on renaming the website.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "\331\204\331\202\330\257 \330\252\331\205 \330\247\331\204\330\247\331\206\330\252\331\207\330\247\330\241 \331\205\331\206 \330\252\331\206\331\201\331\212\330\260 \330\254\331\205\331\212\330\271 \330\247\331\204\330\252\330\271\330\257\331\212\331\204\330\247\330\252 \330\247\331\204\331\205\330\267\331\204\331\210\330\250\330\251 \330\250\330\257\331\202\330\251 \331\205\330\252\331\206\330\247\331\207\331\212\330\251 \331\210\330\250\331\205\330\247 \331\212\330\252\331\210\330\247\331\201\331\202 \330\252\331\205\330\247\331\205\330\247\331\213 \331\205\330\271 \330\247\331\204\331\205\330\271\330\247\331\212\331\212\330\261 \330\247\331\204\330\250\330\261\331\205\330\254\331\212\330\251 \331\210\330\247\331\204\330\252\330\265\331\205\331\212\331\205\331\212\330\251 \330\247\331\204\330\271\330\247\331\204\331\212\330\251 \330\247\331\204\330\252\331\212 \330\267\331\204\330\250\330\252\331\207\330\247\330\214 \331\205\330\271 \330\266\331\205\330\247\331\206 \330\271\330\257\331\205 \330\247\331\204\330\252\330\243\330\253\331\212\330\261 \330\271\331\204\331\211 \330\243\331\212 \331\205\331\206 \330\247\331\204\331\210\330\270\330\247\330\246\331\201 \330\247\331\204\330\243\330\256\330\261\331\211 \331\204\331\204\331\205\331\210\331\202\330\271.\n\n\330\245\331\204\331\212\331\203 \331\205\331\204\330\256\330\265\330\247\331\213 \330\252\331\201\330\265\331\212\331\204\331\212\330\247\331\213 \331\204\331\204\330\243\330\271\331\205\330\247\331\204 \330\247\331\204\330\252\331\212 \330\252\331\205 \330\245\331\206\330\254\330\247\330\262\331\207\330\247:\n\n### 1. \330\245\330\265\331\204\330\247\330\255 \330\255\330\260\331\201 \330\247\331\204\330\243\331\204\330\271\330\247\330\250 \331\210\330\247\331\204\330\261\330\250\330\267 \331\205\330\271 \330\247\331\204\331\210\330\247\330\254\331\207\330\251 \330\247\331\204\330\261\330\263\331\210\331\205\331\212\330\251 \331\205\330\250\330\247\330\264\330\261\330\251\n* **\330\24